name variablelm
category Package
revision 60014
shortdesc Font definitions for the variable Latin Modern fonts
relocated 1
longdesc This package provides a mechanism for scaling a typeface. It is
longdesc directed at the Latin Modern fonts and provides the font
longdesc definitions and the corresponding style file. This mechanism is
longdesc useful in mixed text compositions, for example Japanese-Latin.
runfiles size=14
